                <pb facs="0928" n="808" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg808"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Griscom to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-06-09"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">June 9,
                    1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your telegram of the morning of the 8th received 8 p.m. to-day and presented to
                    the Japanese Government at 11 p.m. Answer follows to-night.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Griscom.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
